{"data":[{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"0_1745370199.705323","card_id":"Q_1898080865973662583","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1898080865973662500,"title":"消息称电商平台将全面取消「仅退款」，这一调整对电商行业意味着什么？将如何影响商家和消费者？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1898080865973662583","type":"question","created":1745317743,"answer_count":349,"follower_count":752,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[186,735,2016131,2196622,2559234],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"据北京商报，拼多多、淘宝、抖音、快手、京东等多个电商平台将全面取消“仅退款”，消费者收到货后的退款不退货申请，将由商家自主处理。 这意味着，“仅退款”在2021年时被拼多多率先推出，后在2024年时被京东、淘宝、抖音、快手等相关平台相继引入，历时四年正式迎来落幕。 记者还获悉，上述电商平台已就全面取消“仅退款”的相关细节与管理部门进行了多轮商讨和修改，一旦审核完成即对社会公开宣布。电商平台全面取消仅退款：电商反内卷一大步，行业回归良性竞争"},"attached_info":"CkoIns2Ki9qz16o0EAMaCTExNDYzMDc2MSDv3p3ABjAAOPAFQAByEzE4OTgwODA4NjU5NzM2NjI1ODN4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"936 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-59c5717ce8dc8359d4ff9913ff573c01_1440w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"1_1745370199.706263","card_id":"Q_1897224478980809260","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1897224478980809200,"title":"英伟达暂停供应 RTX 5090D 显卡，具体情况如何？可能会带来哪些影响？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1897224478980809260","type":"question","created":1745113564,"answer_count":60,"follower_count":311,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound